      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"14469 characters\">&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#666666&quot;&gt;In some circumstances, this is self-evident (YouTube is a logical fit for video), but in others, you may need to conduct additional research and inquiry. Perhaps your LinkedIn followers prefer long-form thought leadership posts, whilst your Facebook followers prefer infographics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
